  "description": "Add Table content to PDF reports VB.NET Guide: This package includes VB.NET sample source code to insert Table text to PDF reporting file using XDoc.PDF VB.NET PDF library\n\nXDoc.PDF from RasterEdge is an advanced Adobe PDF library :\n * Generate PDFs from MS Word, Excel, PowerPoint, TIFF, JPG, PNG and many image formats\n * Convert PDF to Word, multi-page TIFF, SVG, JPG, PNG and other image formats\n * Read, extract text, image, font data, AcroForm data from PDFs\n * Edit, modify existing PDF text, image, bookmark, metadata contents\n * Add, generate, read QR Code and barcode on PDF\n * Convert scanned PDF to editable PDF using OCR\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5\n* .NET Core 3.x, & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.6\n\nOnline Guides :\n* Developer Guide : https://www.rasteredge.com/how-to/vb-net-imaging/pdf-overview/\n* Support : support@rasteredge.com",
